# Level 17 -> Level 18

# Objective:
Retrieve the password for bandit18 stored in passwords.new, which is the only line changed between passwords.old and passwords.new

# breakdown:
The diff command compares two text files line-by-line and highlights the differences between them. Lines preceded by < represent text from the first file (passwords.old), while lines preceded by > represent new text from the second file (passwords.new). The line marked with > contains the password for bandit18.

Command:
diff passwords.old passwords.new
